<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Estoc</h1>
<p>Two-Handed
Average Length: Approx. 4-5 feet
Type of Weapon: Distanced Hand-to-hand.
</p><p>While the existence of one-handed versions is not impossible, the estoc was a two-handed weapon, used solely for thrusting. Its blade was diamond sectioned and had no cutting edge. It was an excellent weapon for piercing chain mail, armor joints, and bodies. Many warriors carried their estoc without a sheath, slung over their back or carried over one shoulder.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla there is no estoc skill of its own: such a weapon is fought with the skill of the kind of weapon it is. Look at it to see which (see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
